OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,FWes Streeting speaks exclusively to
OL,7,FITV News on his first visit to Ukraine.
OL,9,FBritain's new defence secretary has
OL,10,Fsaid Vladimir Putin is losing the war
OL,11,Fin Ukraine and the UK will stand with
OL,12,FUkraine "until they prevail".
OL,14,FWes Streeting's visit to Kyiv on
OL,15,FWednesday came just hours after a wave
OL,16,Fof Russian ballistic missile and drone
OL,17,Fattacks on the city left 17 people
OL,18,Fdead and 44 injured.
OL,26,@tD@IOUtD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
