PN,31702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786018700
OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,FITV News travelled to Kyiv with the
OL,7,Fdefence secretary in what is the first
OL,8,Fvisit to Ukraine by a minister from
OL,9,FAndy Burnham's government.
OL,11,F"The prime minister and I both felt it
OL,12,Fwas important to demonstrate very
OL,13,Fearly on the unwavering and
OL,14,Funequivocal support that this
OL,15,Fgovernment has for Ukraine," Streeting
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FDespite the threat to civilian life,
OL,19,FStreeting said he felt no fear about
OL,20,Fvisiting a warzone for the first time.
OL,26,@sD@AOUwD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
