CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786018700
OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,F"I'm conscious that we are going to a
OL,7,Fcapital city that in recent days, let
OL,8,Falone recent years, has been suffering
OL,9,Fheavy bombardment," he said.
OL,11,FOvernight into Wednesday, Russia fired
OL,12,F24 ballistic missiles and 115 drones
OL,13,Fat Ukrainian civilian warehouses, a
OL,14,Ftrain station and a brewing company.
OL,16,FUkraine's President Volodymyr
OL,17,FZelenskyy said attacks targeted sites
OL,18,F"with no connection to the war".
OL,26,@qD@SO]
