OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FThe defence secretary said Putin was
OL,12,Fresponsible for the "outrageous and
OL,13,Funprovoked invasion" of Ukraine and
OL,14,Fthe loss of Russian life.
OL,16,F"The thing I cannot comprehend is how
OL,17,FRussia's leader can place so little
OL,18,Fvalue on the lives of his own people,
OL,19,Fwho he is sending into this futile
OL,20,Fwar. And it is a war he is losing," he
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,26,@tD@UOUuD@TO]xD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
