OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,FStreeting said he "wouldn't understate
OL,7,Fthe level of US support" and said that
OL,8,Fthe UK was continually working with
OL,9,Fallies to increase assistance in the
OL,10,Fregion.
OL,12,FHe said: "I actually think the US have
OL,13,Fbeen impressed by the way in which the
OL,14,FUkrainians have conducted themselves,
OL,15,Fand particularly defense innovation,
OL,16,Fand the way in which this year in
OL,17,Fparticular has borne out for the
OL,18,FUkrainian front.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
