FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786018700
OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,F"I wouldn't understate the level of of
OL,7,FUS support, of course, we're always
OL,8,Fworking to mobilise more support from
OL,9,Fallies.
OL,11,F"And we also recognise the fact that
OL,12,Fwith the war in Iran, the US is
OL,13,Fcommitted there, but we've got a huge
OL,14,Fcoalition of support for Ukraine, a
OL,15,Fwide range of capability across that
OL,16,Fcoalition."
OL,18,FThe defence secretary also met with
OL,19,Fthe Ukrainian president during his
OL,20,Fvisit.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
