PN,31709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786018700
OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,FStreeting, who resigned from Keir
OL,7,FStarmer's government after May's local
OL,8,Felections, is the fifth UK defence
OL,9,Fsecretary to visit Ukraine since the
OL,10,Fwar began almost four and a half years
OL,11,Fago.
OL,13,FDespite the political turbulence in
OL,14,FBritish politics, Streeting believes
OL,15,Fthere remains an "enormous degree of
OL,16,Fcross-party unity" and support for
OL,17,FUkraine has "united the country".
OL,26,@wD@ROUxD@RO]yD@MOUyD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
