FL,318,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786018700
OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,F"I'm proud that to this day, we enjoy
OL,7,Fthe same support from the Conservative
OL,8,Fopposition that we provided to the
OL,9,FConservative government when we were
OL,10,Fthe Labour opposition," said the
OL,11,Fdefence secretary.
OL,13,FThe UK has been a firm backer of
OL,14,FUkraine since the start of the war in
OL,15,F2022, providing military, diplomatic
OL,16,Fand humanitarian support to the
OL,17,Fcountry.
OL,19,F"We're with Ukraine until they win,"
OL,20,FStreeting said.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@WO]{D@AOU{D@dO]
