OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F317A1786018700
OL,3,C'We're with Ukraine until they win',
OL,4,Csays defence secretary on visit to Kyiv
OL,6,F"This is a fight that we're invested
OL,7,Fin because they are fighting for the
OL,8,Fvery freedom and democracy that we
OL,9,Fcherish ourselves."
OL,11,FIt follows Zelenskyy's visit to the UK
OL,12,Flast week, where he became the first
OL,13,Finternational leader Burnham hosted.
OL,15,FThe pair met at a naval base in
OL,16,FPortsmouth where Burnham reiterated
OL,17,Fthe UK's support for Ukraine and
OL,18,Fannounced a sharing of intellectual
OL,19,Fproperty behind the UK's new "Stone
OL,20,FCloak" electronic warfare system.
